  "seoTitle": "How Hiring Construction Plant Protects Your Cashflow",
  "metaDescription": "Why hiring construction plant instead of buying keeps cash free for wages and materials on Mumbai and Maharashtra projects. A practical guide from RK.",
  "primaryQuery": "hiring construction plant cashflow",
  "date": "2026-08-18",
