  "metaDescription": "Meet Amit and Rajesh Kumar, founders of RK Enterprises — on sites since age 14, now renting and selling checked construction plant across Mumbai.",
  "primaryQuery": "RK Enterprises construction plant Mumbai",
  "date": "2026-09-24",
