  "img": "/img-29414416.jpg",
  "excerpt": "Meet Amit and Rajesh Kumar, founders of RK Enterprises — on sites since age 14, now renting and selling checked construction plant across Mumbai.",
  "lead": "RK Enterprises is a construction plant rental and sale business serving Mumbai, Navi Mumbai and Maharashtra, run by Amit Kumar and Rajesh Kumar. Both started working on construction sites at 14. The company is around four to five years old, but it is built on a lifetime of site experience — and on one simple habit: showing up when the site needs us.",
  "body": "## Who are the founders of RK Enterprises?\n\nAmit Kumar and Rajesh Kumar grew up on construction sites. At 14, while most people their age were in classrooms, they were learning how sites actually run — how a delay in one machine holds up a whole crew, how weather changes a plan, and how much a contractor depends on people who keep their word.\n\nThose years taught them things no course teaches: what a machine should sound like, which faults turn into breakdowns, and why a supplier who answers early in the morning is worth more than a cheaper one who doesn't.\n\n## What does RK Enterprises do?\n\nWe help contractors and builders get the right plant on site, in working order, when they need it. Our work falls into three parts:\n\n- **RSP Rental** — hire plant for the weeks a job needs it, without tying up your cash.\n- **RSP Sale** — buy a machine when your work is steady enough to own one.\n- **Site support and on-call plant** — help when a machine is needed quickly or something goes wrong.\n\n## Why did they start the company?\n\nAfter years on sites, the founders kept seeing the same problems: machines arriving with faults, suppliers who could not be reached, and contractors losing days waiting. Around four to five years ago they started RK Enterprises to do it the way they wished others had done it for them.\n\n## What \"showing up\" means in practice\n\n### Machines checked before dispatch\nEvery machine is checked before it is dispatched. A fault found before dispatch costs minutes; the same fault found on site costs a working day.\n\n### A phone that answers at 5 a.m.\nSites start early. Our phone is on from 5 a.m., and you can reach us on WhatsApp too.\n\n### Straight advice\nSometimes renting is right; sometimes buying is. Because we do both, we can tell you honestly what fits your job and cashflow.\n\n### Local knowledge\nWe work across Mumbai, Navi Mumbai and Maharashtra, so we understand local site conditions, access, and how the monsoon changes the work.\n\n## How to choose a reliable plant hire company\n\nWhoever you hire from, ask these questions:\n\n1. Are machines checked before they are dispatched?\n2. How early can I reach you, and how fast do you respond to a breakdown?\n3. Do you have experience with sites like mine and in my area?\n4. Will you tell me honestly if renting or buying suits me better?\n5. Who do I talk to — a call centre, or someone who knows the machines?\n\nThese are the questions we built RK Enterprises to answer well.\n\n\n## Work with people who show up\n\nIf you need plant for your next job — to rent or to buy — call or WhatsApp RK Enterprises. Tell us what the site needs, and we will help you get it there, checked and ready.",
